  - name: Population defaults
    authority: Kausal
    description: Official municipality population observations from 2000 through 2025
      and the default official projections for Niedersachsen (trend), Rheinland-Pfalz
      (projection) and Brandenburg (middle). Supplied years are interpolated linearly
      and held constant after the final projection through 2045. Association projections
      use the latest common observed member shares; integer allocation preserves totals.
      Source editions, URLs, hashes and derivation are recorded in each row's provenance.
    target: dataset
